<title>JAPAN: Toyota Motor, Denso up on weak yen.</title>
<headline>Toyota Motor, Denso up on weak yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp and its group firm Denso Corporation rose in Tuesday afternoon trade as investors bought the shares due to the weakening of the yen against the dollar, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0451 GMT, Toyota was up 180 yen at 3,460. Denso was up 200 yen or 8.4 percent at 2,590.</p>
</text>
